Cell["\<\
Concentrations in mol/l
Includes Ca indicator dye and assumptions about slow and fast endogenous \
buffers and ATP
Loads imaging data
Updates: Dec. 2017: Inclusion of L-type channels, 2APs added
Jan. 2018: Multiple APs; data scaling\
\>", "Text",
